{"id":"n14490-1-8","stage":3,"title":"보너스 · 奖金","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n14490-1-8-1","ko":"노트북은 언제 사기로 했니?","zh":"你打算什么时候买笔记本电脑啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"노트북은","meaning":"笔记本电脑","explanation":"노트북：笔记本电脑；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"노트북","audio":"/audio/32c2f2cc0bac4b6a9213.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"42929","senseId":"1","lemma":"노트북","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"노트북은","audio":"/audio/620003885a4380d0a8c0.mp3"}},{"text":"언제","meaning":"哪天，哪会儿","explanation":"언제：哪天，哪会儿","readings":[{"term":"언제","audio":"/audio/25f9ca42793d0a69dee9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17856","senseId":"2","lemma":"언제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"언제","audio":"/audio/25f9ca42793d0a69dee9.mp3"}},{"text":"사기로","meaning":"买，购买","explanation":"사다：买，购买；기：将前面的动作或状态转成名词性表达。；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"사다","audio":"/audio/ee0ee072926e06fcb4a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49419","senseId":"1","lemma":"사다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사기로","audio":"/audio/55e295a86e5dba53515e.mp3"}},{"text":"했니?","meaning":"决定","explanation":"하다：决定；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"16","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"했니","audio":"/audio/1889ab3866856ff3fbae.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"32c2f2cc0bac4b6a","term":"노트북","zh":"笔记本电脑","audio":"/audio/32c2f2cc0bac4b6a9213.mp3","entryId":"42929","definition":"可随身携带使用、做得很轻巧的个人电脑。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"25f9ca42793d0a69","term":"언제","zh":"哪天，哪会儿","audio":"/audio/25f9ca42793d0a69dee9.mp3","entryId":"17856","definition":"在不明确指定的未来某个时间。","pronunciation":["언ː제"]},{"id":"ee0ee072926e06fc","term":"사다","zh":"买，购买","audio":"/audio/ee0ee072926e06fcb4a4.mp3","entryId":"49419","definition":"用钱使某种东西或权利为己所有。","pronunciation":["사다"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"决定","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"把某事定下来。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/b85f393be1a65d45790e.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n14490-1-8-2","ko":"이번 달에 보너스를 받으니까 곧 살 수 있을 거야.","zh":"这个月能拿到奖金，应该很快就能买了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이번","meaning":"这次，这回","explanation":"이번：这次，这回","readings":[{"term":"이번","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29737","senseId":"1","lemma":"이번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이번","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3"}},{"text":"달에","meaning":"月","explanation":"달：月；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"달","audio":"/audio/2f941e6eb2150679c43f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62266","senseId":"2","lemma":"달","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"달에","audio":"/audio/0f8e45b47a9b54bf0acc.mp3"}},{"text":"보너스를","meaning":"奖金","explanation":"보너스：奖金；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"보너스","audio":"/audio/1e6c6086110c570346c7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14490","senseId":"1","lemma":"보너스","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보너스를","audio":"/audio/bf621fa62af2ee3cf788.mp3"}},{"text":"받으니까","meaning":"收到 ，得到","explanation":"받다：收到 ，得到；으니까：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"받다","audio":"/audio/5af01487318c0c571462.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66636","senseId":"1","lemma":"받다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"받으니까","audio":"/audio/c18a665b6d8d1427757c.mp3"}},{"text":"곧","meaning":"马上，就","explanation":"곧：马上，就","readings":[{"term":"곧","audio":"/audio/c2f53c24d77970856333.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26802","senseId":"1","lemma":"곧","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"곧","audio":"/audio/c2f53c24d77970856333.mp3"}},{"text":"살","meaning":"燃，燃着","explanation":"살다：燃，燃着；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测